---
title: SalesOrder State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Allocating : Retailer/Sales submits SO (account, service radius, price, promotion, credit validated)
    Allocating --> Quoted : real-time allocation covers every line, reservation + price snapshot committed
    Allocating --> AllocationFailed : stock shortage (OutOfStock), whole SO rolled back, no reservation
    Allocating --> AllocationConflict : optimistic-lock conflict after 3 automatic retries
    Allocating --> Cancelled : Retailer/Sales withdraws SO before allocation commits
    AllocationConflict --> Allocating : technical retry (retry queue or Admin/Operator Retry)
    AllocationConflict --> Cancelled : Retailer/Sales withdraws SO
    AllocationFailed --> Allocating : quantities adjusted and SO resubmitted
    AllocationFailed --> Cancelled : Retailer/Sales withdraws SO
    Quoted --> AwaitingPayment : Retailer accepts quote and chooses Prepaid (deadline N days)
    Quoted --> PurchaseOrderIssued : Retailer accepts quote on Credit (eligibility and credit limit pass)
    Quoted --> Rejected : Retailer rejects quote (reason required, reservation released)
    Quoted --> Expired : quote deadline passed (reservation released)
    AwaitingPayment --> PurchaseOrderIssued : prepayment confirmed in full
    AwaitingPayment --> Expired : payment deadline passed (quote closed, reservation released)
    PurchaseOrderIssued --> Picking : picking lists issued per warehouse, first valid QR batch scan
    Picking --> Issued : every warehouse portion picked and stock issued at dispatch confirmation
    Issued --> Delivering : shipments handed to driver/vehicle
    Delivering --> Delivered : Retailer confirms receipt of every shipment
    Delivered --> Completed : payment settled and no open claim (Loyalty points awarded)
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    Expired --> [*]
    Completed --> [*]
